# Mycoplasma agalactiae, the four locus MLVA of McAuliffe et al. 2008, anchored on the type strain PG2.
# Primers are Table 1 as published. The Magal_VNTR5 reverse primer carries mismatches to the PG2
# genome, so that locus is found by the aligned rescue pass rather than at word size 11; it gives the
# published 226 bp product there. The search window is wide because the paper reports no per-locus
# range.
Magal_VNTR5	GAAAGAGAAAGGAAGCTGAA	GGATCATTATCGCTTTTGA	60-900
Magal_VNTR14	TTGAAATATCCGCTTAAGAAA	AATTTGCATTTAATGGTGCT	60-900
Magal_VNTR17	TTTAGCTTTTGATTCAATACTTTC	AAAGAATTATGCGAGCATTT	60-900
Magal_VNTR19	TTGCTTCTTGTGCTTCTTTT	AAGGGGATCAACCAGATAAT	60-900
